<h2>Dark Age of Camelot New Member Application</h2><h3><font color=red>Please note Ilsik Haucil resides in Albion on the Lancelot Server</font></h3><p>If you are interested in becomming a member of Ilsik Haucil, the best way to
      do so is to fill out the application form below and then look up members online 
      to group with.  Guild members who have volunteered to contact people interested in 
      joining the guild include:<br>
      <a href="mailto:meyerj2@2-cool.com">Saidan</a><br>
      <a href="mailto:cynthia@utahdogs.com">Oliv</a><br>
      <a href="mailto:cagwyn@erols.com">Larren</a><p>Once you group with various members if Ilsik Haucil, you will
      need to have two people sponsor you into the guild as a dedicated.  When you are
      dedicated, you will be given the guild tag.  Usually people will become sponsors when they
      know you and have played with you some.  Getting to know the people in the guild ensures 
      gaming styles will match, as each has their own style of gaming, grouping, and
      interracting with others in DAoC.</p><p>After you become a dedicated you will remain so for an amount of time as you continue
      to group with full guild members and go on various raids.  After some time passes,
      a time frame agreed upon by the two sponsors, they will ask the guild leader to call
      for a vote of the full members. The full members will then vote on whether they would
      like you to become a full member of the guild.  The policy for new members is currently
      undergoing modification for DAoC.. please check back for more information</p><p>Please fill out the below form.  Your answers will be emailed
      directly to the guild leaders and also given to other guildmembers so we can all
      get to know you.</p><p><FORM action="http://www.response-o-matic.com/cgi-bin/rom.pl" method="POST">
